    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        1075,
        1985,
        1355
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On June 2, 1947, I issued an order creating a Division of Analysis in the Budget Director's Office. It was my aim that this Division would, in cooperation with the various city departments, work out methods to promote efficiency in organization and procedures and help in the solution of specific problems confronting any department.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2611,
          "min": -1.8085
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 66,
          "mean": -0.0016,
          "min": -0.101
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 14103,
        "area_px": 474890,
        "density": 0.0297,
        "chars": 333,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 23.61
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        1382,
        1945,
        1802
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to obtain the best possible team work to accomplish these purposes, you are requested to create in your department a small unit to work in close cooperation with the Analysis Division. This unit should serve a two-fold purpose: first, it should suggest to the Commissioner possible studies which will improve department efficiency. The Commissioner should then forward these suggested studies to the Analysis Division for its aid in making such survey. Second, it should work in cooperation with the Analysis Division to carry out the objectives of such completed surveys.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2543,
          "min": -1.663
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 101,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0233
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 22613,
        "area_px": 697950,
        "density": 0.0324,
        "chars": 581,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.69
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        1821,
        1923,
        2158
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In view of the importance of this function, you are urged to designate those individuals who, in your opinion, are best fitted to analyze the organization, procedures and personnel within your department and to suggest improvements therein. This unit should include the budget officer for your department who will be able to apply the experience of this unit in preparing proper budget estimates.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2484,
          "min": -1.7695
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 69,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0089
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13828,
        "area_px": 551892,
        "density": 0.02506,
        "chars": 396,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 28.64
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        2180,
        1973,
        2298
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A suitable training program, under the supervision of the Division of Analysis, will be instituted to assist such individuals.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2581,
          "min": -1.679
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 22,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0089
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5171,
        "area_px": 199682,
        "density": 0.0259,
        "chars": 126,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 24.37
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        2316,
        1875,
        2572
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As soon as you have created such an analysis unit, will you please forward their names, together with the designation of the person in charge of such unit and of the budget officer, to Mr. Abraham D. Beame, Assistant Director of the Budget and Head of the Analysis Division.",
